{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72237","main_id":72237,"main_title":"安提戈努斯","main_description":"在悬空牢知道了一些故事，你决定前去寻找…","chapter_title":"安提戈努斯","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":0,"subquest_id":7223703,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7223703,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":722370310,"next_line_ids":[722370311],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":20480,"speaker_text_hash":2459924605,"speaker":"安贞","speaker_raw":"安贞","text_hash":2602001250,"text":"我为了停下他们的机关巨物，和它周旋了很久。最后我扯下了它的核心。但是我也因此受了重伤。","raw_text":"我为了停下他们的机关巨物，和它周旋了很久。最后我扯下了它的核心。但是我也因此受了重伤。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7223703.json"}
